doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22765692"
# Published Zenodo version DOI for v1.0.0-preprint (deposition 22765692),
# published 2026-09-15. This deposit's concept DOI is deliberately not written
# anywhere in this repository: `check_doi_consistency` treats any occurrence of
